  "title": "A New Remote Opportunity for Full Stack Engineers",
  "fields": {
    "Zleceniodawca": "William Adams",
    "Opis": "We’re expanding our engineering team and looking for talented Mid–Senior Full Stack Engineers who are interested in building great products, working with modern technologies, and becoming part of a long-term international team.\n\nThis is a 100% remote opportunity, with the chance to work on exciting projects for European clients and collaborate with experienced professionals from different backgrounds.",
    "Opublikowano": "2026-08-31",
    "Kategoria": "Strony internetowe",
    "Prawa autorskie": "Decyzja freelancera",
    "Wymagane funkcje": "We’re interested in engineers who have:\n\nMid–Senior level full-stack development experience\nStrong problem-solving and analytical skills\nGood understanding of modern software development practices\nC1 English or higher, with confident written and spoken communication\nReliable, high-speed internet and a professional remote setup\nA proactive attitude and strong sense of ownership\nThe ability to communicate clearly and work independently",
    "Preferowane rozwiązanie": "I am looking for a custom, original solution rather than a ready-made platform. The project should be scalable, secure, user-friendly, and optimized for performance. I am open to discussing the best technology stack and architecture based on the project requirements.",
    "Budżet": "Do negocjacji",
    "Ważne przez": "30 dni"
